additional_context = "Use the dynamic_list_scheduling helper from solver_lib for list scheduling: maintain a priority queue of ready operations (initially first ops per job) sorted by longest processing time. Use a separate min-heap for each machine's availability time. When an operation is selected and scheduled, immediately add its successor to the ready queue if any, and assign it to the machine that becomes free earliest. This enables true interleaving and dynamic re-prioritization when machines idle, dramatically improving utilization on large instances like tai100_20.txt."